Surface Coal Mine<br>
Fatal Powered Haulage Accident<br>
November 28, 2006 
<br><br>
at 
 <br><br>
Spring Creek Coal Company Mine<br>
Spring Creek Coal Company<br>
Decker, Big Horn County, Montana<br>
 ID No. 24-01457
<br><br>

Accident Investigators 
<br><br>
Phillip Gibson<br>
Coal Mine Safety and Health Inspector
<br><br>
William Younkin<br>
Coal Mine Safety and Health Inspector
<br><br>
Robert Montoya<br>
Educational Field Services Training Specialist
<br><br>
Ronald Medina<br>
Technical Support Mechanical Engineer
<br><br>
Peter Del Duca<br>
Mining Engineer
<br><br>
Originating Office<br>
